Package: dlvm
Title: Dynamic Latent Variable Model
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Charlie", "Carter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "charlie@example.com")
Description: Bayesian dynamic latent variable model for panel data with
    irregular time spacing, variable observation counts per period, and
    optional measurement uncertainty. Uses a random-walk latent process
    with Student-t observation model, compiled and sampled via CmdStan.
    Supports multi-threaded execution via TBB and reduce_sum.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/charliecarter/dlvm
Encoding: UTF-8
